{
  "name": "Post-launch Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9919)\n- **Schedule:** Cron `0 0 * * *` (daily midnight **UTC**).\n- **Daily idempotency:** Global static data stores `lastProcessedDate` (UTC `YYYY-MM-DD`); a second run the same day exits with no pull.\n- **Pull:** GET **/v1/post-launch/performance?date={processingDate}** via MPA (2 retries, 30s apart on this node).\n- **Reconcile:** POST **/v1/post-launch/reconcile** with pull payload + date; response includes `hasDiscrepancies` and `discrepancies`.\n- **Discrepancy rule:** MPA sets `hasDiscrepancies` when any metric’s planned vs actual differs by more than 1%.\n- **Proposal:** POST **/v1/post-launch/precedent-proposals** when `hasDiscrepancies` is true.\n- **No discrepancies:** Set node only (no downstream calls).\n- **Failures:** POST **/v1/post-launch/team-alert** (`team: post-launch`, email).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "20000001-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000001",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 0 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "20000002-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000002",
      "name": "Daily Midnight UTC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nif (staticData.lastProcessedDate === today) {\n  return [{ json: { processingDate: today, skipped: true } }];\n}\nstaticData.lastProcessedDate = today;\nreturn [{ json: { processingDate: today, skipped: false } }];"
      },
      "id": "20000003-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000003",
      "name": "Mark Processing Day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "skipped-today",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.skipped }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000004-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000004",
      "name": "Already Processed Today",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "skip-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'No action: performance data already processed for ' + $json.processingDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "skip-date",
              "name": "processingDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.processingDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000005-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000005",
      "name": "No Action Duplicate Day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        960,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://mpa-api.example/v1/post-launch/performance?date={{ $json.processingDate }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000006-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000006",
      "name": "Pull Performance Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        400
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 30000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mpa-api-cred-id",
          "name": "MPA API service credential"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://mpa-api.example/v1/post-launch/reconcile",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"processingDate\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Mark Processing Day').item.json.processingDate) }},\n  \"performance\": {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000007-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000007",
      "name": "Reconcile Plan And Actual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mpa-api-cred-id",
          "name": "MPA API service credential"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-disc",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hasDiscrepancies }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000008-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000008",
      "name": "Discrepancies Found",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://mpa-api.example/v1/post-launch/precedent-proposals",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"processingDate\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Mark Processing Day').item.json.processingDate) }},\n  \"discrepancies\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.discrepancies ?? []) }},\n  \"status\": \"pending-approval\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000009-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000009",
      "name": "Propose Precedent For Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mpa-api-cred-id",
          "name": "MPA API service credential"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ok-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'No precedent proposal: planned and actual aligned for ' + $('Mark Processing Day').item.json.processingDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ok-date",
              "name": "processingDate",
              "value": "={{ $('Mark Processing Day').item.json.processingDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000010-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000010",
      "name": "No Discrepancies No Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1800,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://mpa-api.example/v1/post-launch/team-alert",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"team\": \"post-launch\",\n  \"channel\": \"email\",\n  \"subject\": \"Post-launch workflow failure\",\n  \"processingDate\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Mark Processing Day').item.json.processingDate ?? '') }},\n  \"errorMessage\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.error?.message ?? $json.message ?? 'Post-launch step failed') }},\n  \"failedNode\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.error?.node?.name ?? 'Pull Performance Data') }}\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000011-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000011",
      "name": "Log And Email Post Launch Team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mpa-api-cred-id",
          "name": "MPA API service credential"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fb-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'Post-launch team alert could not be sent via MPA: ' + ($json.error?.message ?? 'unknown error') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20000012-bbbb-cccc-dddd-000000000012",
      "name": "Log Unrecoverable Post Launch Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2080,
        820
      ]
    }
  ],
